Times list of values (for both P42_START_TIME and P42_END_TIME), every 30 minutes:

SELECT TO_CHAR(DATE '2000-01-01' + (LEVEL - 1) / 48, 'HH:MI AM') AS d,
       TO_CHAR(DATE '2000-01-01' + (LEVEL - 1) / 48, 'HH24:MI')  AS r
